# Rust build output for `apps/model-explorer/rust/`. `target/` is also
# covered by the workspace-root `.gitignore` but we mirror it locally for the
# case where contributors run cargo from within this directory in isolation.
target/
# The lockfile IS tracked here. Trunk lints this directory as its own
# workspace and invokes `cargo clippy --locked`, which exits 101 with
# "cannot create the lock file ... because --locked was passed" when no lock
# is committed, so ignoring it made every `Lint & Format` run that touched a
# crate in here fail before producing a single lint (observed 2026-11-12 on
# PR #940, run 43184486398). Every other nested workspace in this repo
# (perf-core, iac, python/ffi) tracks its lock for the same reason. Refresh
# deliberately with `cargo update` rather than letting resolution float.

# Operator-local tantivy index cache. `seed build` populates this directory
# by default; contributors regenerate it on demand. Never commit the cache.
hwledger-index/
